# RUN:   --request=%t/fs.req.json -o=/dev/null %t/rc.mlirbc | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=COMPILED
# COMPILED: artifact judgment
# COMPILED-NOT: belongs to no transformer

# The structural half of the derivation, on both implementations. The bounds
# themselves are C++-only; the shared surface is the plan the two legs walk
# to reach them.
